<title>FINLAND: LONGER HELIBOR RATES RISE SLIGHTLY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>LONGER HELIBOR RATES RISE SLIGHTLY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Longer Helibor rates rose</p>
<p>slightly at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>3-month rate was flat at 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>					May 29 fix	   May 28 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			 3.01 pct	     3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			 3.03 pct	     3.03 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			 3.07 pct	     3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			 3.19 pct	     3.18 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			 3.29 pct	     3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			3.42 pct	     3.41 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
